From 992882e076752042fa81033173040b0f17806743 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:18:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Match the LG Infrared integration's buttons and event names

Use up, down, left and right for the arrow keys, drop buttons for keys the
media player already covers, only disable the rarely used keys, and list
the buttons and event types explicitly. Mark the quality scale as
platinum, since strict typing is done and the other rules are exempt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RrPaBaU6zM6AhoWcyUefct
